      <activity id="6c649a3b-6847-50dd-85d9-c9b3d68e46e0" activityNameId="3407b070-f138-5f5b-9642-7cb7e30fc042" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Steel, electric, chromium steel 18/8, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Steel, electric, chromium steel 18/8, at plant
This process produces secondary steel. Only scrap is used as iron bearing input.;
UUID: 8a33231b-294c-3d48-aef0-89d8d9e71ede
Transports of scrap metal and other input materials to electric arc furnace, steel making process and casting.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: EU technology mix (mainly furnace with 4th hole, partly with additional evacuation of building atmosphere). An average for different alloys is represented.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: based on literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_8a33231b-294c-3d48-aef0-89d8d9e71ede.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
